 rg/membership. Tickets: To look up your tickets or re-send an email confir
 mation\, please visit: https://tickets.thetrustees.org/orders\n\nSources: 
 North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/holiday-wreat
 h-making-workshop/
LOCATION:Stevens-Coolidge House &amp\; Gardens\, 153 Chickering Road\, Nor
 th Andover\, MA\, 01845
