BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:An Evening with Marc Roberge (of O.A.R.)
DTSTART:20261209T200000
DTEND:20261209T213000
DTSTAMP:20261115T180125Z
UID:efb2a180c73860a51c2c87b643ed3d@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:As frontman for multi-platinum-selling rock band O.A.R.\, Marc
  Roberge has performed for sold-out crowds at some of the world’s most i
 conic venues while helping build a remarkably devoted global fanbase. Thre
 e decades into O.A.R.’s career\, the New York City-based singer/songwrit
 er/guitarist has also developed a distinct identity as a solo performer. R
 oberge’s solo shows trade the full-band energy of O.A.R. for an intimate
 \, stripped-back setting\, featuring reimagined O.A.R. favorites\, select 
 covers and candid conversation with the audience. The format puts a spotli
 ght on the deeply personal storytelling that has been central to his songw
 riting since O.A.R.’s formation in 1996. Inspired in part by the traditi
 on of classic country and folk troubadours\, Roberge continues to explore 
 the more lyrical and roots-oriented side of his songwriting through his so
 lo work.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.or
 g/event/an-evening-with-marc-roberge-of-o-a-r/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/an-evening-with-marc-roberge-of-o-a-r/
END:VEVENT
